    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSuperb opportunity to acquire and refurbish a Three-bedroom cottage on a 0.11 ha site with direct access from main road located just on the southern outskirts of vibrant, Dromod Village. \n\nThe property has been approved for a grant of 70,000 through the Croi Cónaithe (Towns) Fund. \n\nDromod is an award-winning Shannon side village with a best of natural amenities on its doorstep together with crèche, GAA Pitch, renowned pubs & restaurants, cafe, filling station/ garage etc. \n\nThe property is a traditional style cottage residence with single storey extension offering the following accommodation: \n\nThree Bedrooms, one Bathroom, Kitchen/Dining room & Sitting Room. OFCH requires replacement of oil burner and related work. Kitchen solid fuel stove and open fireplace / solid fuel stove. \n\nNice enclosed, mature site with old outbuilding and boiler house together with polytunnel. \nThe nearby town of Carrick-on-Shannon is approx. 16 km away, offering a convenient 15 minute drive, and Longford 20 minutes away. All expressions of interest are invited. A blank canvas for the purchaser to create their ideal home in a superb location. For further information contact our Sherry FitzGerald Farrell office in Carrick on Shannon on 071 9620976.\n\n\nThese particulars have been prepared by Sherry FitzGerald Farrell and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of Sherry FitzGerald Farrell. PSRA Licence: 003400"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen / Dining room - 3.45m x 3.67m\nKitchen with solid fuel stove\n\nHall - 4.33m x 0.92m\n\n\nLiving Room ,Fireplace w. Stove - 3.55m x 3.14m\nOFCH requires replacement of oil burner and related work.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.58m x 2.66m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.63m x 3.13m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.42m 2.36m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.45m x 1.82m\n\n\n"
      },
